      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "There is a valid argument that technological progress is becoming increasingly self-reinforcing, making it challenging to anticipate the consequences of our policy choices. As AI and automation continue to advance, they have the potential to become a self-sustaining feedback loop, driving further innovation and change beyond human control. This perspective suggests that, despite our efforts to intervene, the trajectory of technological evolution may ultimately be impossible to alter.",
